<title>USA: Sears June domestic same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Sears June domestic same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>HOFFMAN ESTATES, Ill. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sears, Roebuck and Co said Thursday its domestic same-store sales for the five weeks ended July 5 rose 3.1 percent.</p>
<p>This compared with a 7.7 percent increase in the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>For the 22 weeks ended July 5, Sears said its domestic same store sales rose two percent.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
